{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：06:10 2026-11-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：06:10 2026-11-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：06:10 2026-11-12 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5abc76a69d6fe5c25426bcfa280a5111/2026-11/princewales.jpg\"/><p>周三（11日）晚上11時許，45歲姓林女子在沙田正街偉華中心一個單位內暈倒，倒臥於床上，其母親報警求助。人員接報到場，林女昏迷送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，其後被證實死亡。死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>據了解，林女身體患病，2日前才到威爾斯親王醫院求醫，同日出院。案件交由沙田警區雜項調查隊跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:07:18.188351+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T22:10:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:21:25.230913+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:53.269782+00:00","content_hash":"74fdaf38cd09ce2f69cfb0e0d4256471f5419da1dbb1a74c88919a1ca68bccb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}